msgid "Do you have a mobile app?"
msgstr "Je, kuna programu ya simu?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "In the works!"
msgstr "Inatengenezwa!"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Where do the currency and metal rates come from?"
msgstr "Viwango vya sarafu na madini vinatoka wapi?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Gold and silver prices are fetched daily from Swissquote's forex data feed. For each metal, the calculator takes the midpoint of every valid bid/ask quote and uses the median of those midpoints. Currency exchange rates come from FXRatesAPI. The displayed timestamp shows when the latest complete snapshot was successfully retrieved."
msgstr "Bei za dhahabu na fedha hupatikana kila siku kutoka kwa mkondo wa data ya fedha za kigeni wa Swissquote. Kwa kila madini, kikokotoo huchukua thamani ya kati ya kila bei halali ya kununua na kuuza, kisha hutumia thamani ya kati ya matokeo hayo. Viwango vya ubadilishaji wa sarafu hutoka FXRatesAPI. Muhuri wa muda unaoonyeshwa unaonyesha wakati data kamili ya hivi karibuni ilipopatikana kwa mafanikio."

#: src/routes/+layout.svelte
msgid "About the Mithqal Calculator: a free tool for converting mithqals of gold and silver to any currency, used for Huqúqu'lláh calculations."
msgstr "Kuhusu Kikokotoo cha mithqál: zana ya bure ya kubadilisha mithqál za dhahabu na fedha kuwa sarafu yoyote, inayotumika katika mahesabu ya Huqúqu’lláh."

